    "description": "Welcome to Car Crash Driving Test Game 3D! Enjoy driving different types of cars and destroying them in hundreds of different ways.\r\nThe obstacles and elements for smashing vehicles that you will find on the map are very diverse: very long ramps where you can make incredible jumps where each jump ends in a different way (crashing into a wall, falling down a cliff full of bars, falling to the ground, etc.), perform impressive loops, put the car under the pressure of a hammer or a crusher, avoid or crash into rotating balls and sticks or take your car through the different crushers that you will find, each more dangerous than the previous one.",
